# UST.G3BO H11 Endpoint Correction Action At One Split Prime

## Result

The exact H11 inverse action at the G3BI endpoint has now been executed on the
complete selected correction source modulo one completely split prime. For
every H20 residue basis element `P`, G3BO solves

```text
A_G3BI X_P = -3 P sC
```

at all six roots of the selected sextic modulo `21817`.

All six endpoint charts are invertible, every `5439 x 248` linear-system
residual is zero, and six-root interpolation emits the unique power-basis
residue

```text
X mod 21817 in (GF(21817)[gamma]/M(gamma))^(5439 x 248).
```

The tensor contains `5,994,683` nonzero coefficients in shape
`5439 x 248 x 6`.

## Exact Source Binding

The right-hand side is not inherited from the old B89 physical direction. It
is rebuilt coefficientwise from G3BI's 19-term correction and the formula

```text
R_P = -3 P sC.
```

Its canonical characteristic-zero coordinate-stream hash agrees exactly with
G3BK. For each split root, the verifier independently reconstructs the
endpoint chart, reconstructs all 248 right-hand sides, multiplies the stored
solution back through the chart, and checks zero residual.

## What This Closes

G3BN proved only that an H11 endpoint inverse exists over `Q(gamma)`. G3BO
performs that inverse action at one fully split prime and retains both parts
needed downstream:

```text
1013 quotient coordinates,
4426 original-Jacobian preimage coordinates.
```

Thus the H11 correction action has moved from an unevaluated source stream to
an exact modular operator action.

## Why The Characteristic-Zero Action Is Still Open

One split prime determines the answer only modulo `21817`. The six roots
recover the degree-less-than-six power-basis representation inside that finite
field, but they do not determine the rational numerator and denominator over
`Q(gamma)`.

Promotion requires one of:

1. enough additional split primes, CRT accumulation, and a proved rational-
   reconstruction bound; or
2. an independent exact annihilating relation that uniquely determines the
   characteristic-zero action.

No measured value, floating-point fit, or free parameter enters this modular
calculation.

## Claim Boundary

G3BO does not yet prove:

- exact rational reconstruction of the H11 action over `Q(gamma)`;
- the recursive divergence back to H20;
- an H02 endpoint inverse action;
- integral transport along the whole G3BJ arc;
- terminal B89 coordinates; or
- the 248-row G3BD decision.

